sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Caller
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant W as Worker
  U->>O: SendMessage<br/>traceparent: T, C1
  Note over O: S1, child of C1<br/>same trace T
  O->>W: SendMessage<br/>traceparent: T, C2
  Note over W: S2, child of C2
  W-->>O: Task
  O-->>U: Task
  Note over U,W: each exports its spans: one trace T<br/>C1 → S1 → … → C2 → S2
